Neural network

The notebook train_wmh_nn.ipynb trains a pixel-wise neural network classifier.

Workflow:
1. Load the same datasets using wmh_preprocessing.py.
2. Build a DataFrame where each row is one pixel and each column is one feature.
3. Split the data by slice into train, validation, and test sets.
4. Balance the training set by keeping all WMH pixels and sampling non-WMH pixels.
5. Train an MLPClassifier using the nine extracted features.
6. Select the best probability threshold on the validation set by maximizing Dice score.
7. Evaluate train, validation, and test performance.
8. Save outputs in nn_output/.

